cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below. Status: protocol v1.0 frozen (owner-approved 2026-11-24); all six confirmatory experiments complete; manuscript draft, not peer-reviewed. An AI system was used as a research and development assistant; it is not an author."
title: "Individually optimal routing and total travel time on synthetic grid networks: a preregistered simulation study"
abstract: "An offline, reproducible simulation study of whether individually optimal routing can worsen collective travel time, on a Braess network and seeded grids, with a second test on the TNTP Sioux Falls network (not redistributed)."
type: software
authors:
